<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Finnish minister hopes for EMU pact deal tonight.</title>
<headline>Finnish minister hopes for EMU pact deal tonight.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Finance Minister Sauli Niinisto said he hoped the EU would be able to reach agreement on Thursday night over a stability pact to enforce fiscal discipline after monetary union.</p>
<p>Asked whether he thought there would be agreement at a meeting of EU finance ministers now underway in Dublin, he said &quot;Well at least I hope so.&quot;</p>
</text>
